				<p>The Lord Chancellor makes these <ref class="placeholder" href="#varDocSubType"/> in exercise of the powers conferred by section 2(3) and 41(1)(a) and (b) of the Legal Aid, Sentencing and Punishment of Offenders Act 2012<authorialNote GUID="_cd353fc0-144e-4c8e-9571-65bf1158572e" class="footnote" eId="fnote_2" marker="2">
